Portions of the liquid glass controls in web/liquid-toggle.js,
web/liquid-tabbar.js and web/liquid-button.js (spring solvers, velocity
tracker, lens refraction with chromatic dispersion, toggle combined
backdrop, ambient and default rim highlights, the bottom-tab indicator and
InteractiveHighlight press dynamics, and the component geometry, colours and
spring constants) are adapted from this project's renderer and shader
sources; web/liquid-button.css and web/liquid-sheet.css follow its
LiquidButton and Dialog materials. The code was translated from
TypeScript/GLSL into framework-free JavaScript/GLSL and modified to
render inside individual DOM controls.

That project is itself a web port of AndroidLiquidGlass by Kyant
(https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass).
